Field Description / Notes:
The name of a device in the scope of a quality conformity assessment procedure.

Note: Only one of the following must be given for adding a device in the scope of a quality conformity assessment procedure:
- Basic UDI-DI;
- Name;
- Reference/Catalogue number.

The reference/catalogue number of a device in the scope of a quality conformity assessment procedure.

Note: Only one of the following must be given for adding a device in the scope of a quality conformity assessment procedure:
- Basic UDI-DI and issuing entity;
- Name;
- Reference/Catalogue number.
